<title>USA: Coachmen authorizes shares repurchase.</title>
<headline>Coachmen authorizes shares repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coachmen Industries Inc said Friday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to one million share of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Shares may be purchased from time to time, depending on market conditions and other factors, on the open market or through privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
